---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import status from "../../data/status.json";
const browserStatus = status.entries.find((entry) => entry.id === "lumen-browser-public-evidence");
---
<SiteLayout title="Aurora — Independent Rust OS & Lumen Browser (In Development)" description="Aurora is an independent computing project developing a from-scratch Rust operating system and Lumen, its web browser. Both are in development.">
  <section class="home-cinema">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="home-cinema-inner">
        <div class="home-cinema-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> AN INDEPENDENT COMPUTING PROJECT</p>
          <h1>An operating system<br />and browser, <span>built deliberately.</span></h1>
          <p class="home-cinema-description">Aurora OS is a from-scratch operating-system project written in Rust, following a capability-based microkernel direction. Lumen is its web browser. Both are in development.</p>
          <div class="home-cinema-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/en/development/">Follow verified progress <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/en/engineering/architecture/">Read the architecture</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-cinema-art">
          <img src="/aurora-hero.svg" alt="Aurora's geometric symbol above a luminous planetary horizon" width="760" height="480" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-cinema-foot"><span>01 — INDEPENDENT COMPUTING</span><span>OS / BROWSER / PUBLIC PROJECT NOTES</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-products-cinema shell" id="ecosystem" aria-label="Aurora products">
    <article class="home-cinema-product">
      <div class="home-cinema-product-copy">
        <p class="home-cinema-section-label">01 / OPERATING SYSTEM</p>
        <h2>Aurora <span>OS</span></h2>
        <p>A from-scratch operating-system project written in Rust, with a capability-based microkernel direction. The OS repository is private; public implementation evidence has not yet been independently reviewed on this website.</p>
        <div class="home-cinema-status"><i></i><span>IN DEVELOPMENT · PUBLIC EVIDENCE NOT VERIFIED</span></div>
        <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/ecosystem/os/">EXPLORE AURORA OS <span>↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-concept home-concept-os" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual visual representing Aurora OS, not a product screenshot">
        <div class="home-os-ring"></div><div class="home-os-horizon"></div><div class="home-os-core"><span>AU</span></div>
        <span class="home-concept-caption">CONCEPT VISUAL / NOT A PRODUCT SCREENSHOT</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="home-cinema-product">
      <div class="home-cinema-product-copy">
        <p class="home-cinema-section-label">02 / WEB BROWSER</p>
        <h2>Lumen</h2>
        <p>The web-browser workstream of the Aurora ecosystem. Its rendering engine, supported platforms and privacy behavior are not yet documented as verified product capabilities.</p>
        <div class="home-cinema-status"><i></i><span>{browserStatus?.reportedStage?.toUpperCase() ?? "IN DEVELOPMENT"} · PUBLIC EVIDENCE NOT VERIFIED</span></div>
        <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/ecosystem/browser/">EXPLORE LUMEN <span>↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-concept home-concept-lumen" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual browser interface for Lumen, not a product screenshot">
        <div class="home-lumen-window">
          <div class="home-lumen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="home-lumen-address"></div></div>
          <div class="home-lumen-page"><small>LUMEN / BROWSER CONCEPT</small><strong>Clarity<br /><em>over noise.</em></strong></div>
        </div>
        <span class="home-concept-caption">CONCEPT VISUAL / NOT A PRODUCT SCREENSHOT</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="home-cinema-end shell">
    <p>Progress is reported with explicit evidence boundaries. No public release is currently verified.</p>
    <div class="home-cinema-actions">
      <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/development/">VIEW DEVELOPMENT STATUS <span>↘</span></a>
      <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/docs/faq/">READ THE FAQ <span>↘</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <style>
    .home-cinema-art { min-height: 0; }
    .home-cinema-art img { display: block; width: min(100%, 650px); height: auto; justify-self: end; filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 65px rgba(0, 160, 190, .12)); }
    .home-cinema-bridge { position: relative; min-height: 430px; display: grid; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; border-block: 1px solid rgba(150, 200, 210, .13); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%, rgba(0, 160, 185, .13), transparent 55%), linear-gradient(180deg, #05090d, #07131b 50%, #05090d); }
    .home-cinema-bridge::before, .home-cinema-bridge::after { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: min(1000px, 90vw); aspect-ratio: 2.8; border: 1px solid rgba(87, 211, 225, .18); border-radius: 50%; content: ""; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-9deg); }
    .home-cinema-bridge::before { bottom: -72%; }
    .home-cinema-bridge::after { bottom: -83%; width: min(1250px, 110vw); border-color: rgba(87, 211, 225, .1); }
    .home-cinema-bridge-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; min-height: 430px; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; }
    .home-cinema-bridge-inner > span { color: #718d9a; font: 8px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .16em; }
    .home-cinema-bridge-inner p { margin: 28px 0; font: 500 clamp(46px, 7.4vw, 94px)/.94 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.08em; }
    .home-cinema-bridge-inner p em { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
    .home-cinema-bridge-line { width: min(360px, 65%); height: 1px; margin-bottom: 25px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent); }
    .home-products-cinema { padding-block: clamp(95px, 12vw, 160px); }
    .home-cinema-product { gap: 7vw; padding-block: 85px; }
    .home-cinema-product + .home-cinema-product { padding-top: 110px; }
    .home-concept { min-height: clamp(390px, 43vw, 570px); }
    .home-cinema-end { min-height: 250px; padding-block: 75px 95px; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .home-cinema-art { min-height: 0; margin-top: 25px; }
      .home-cinema-art img { width: 100%; }
      .home-cinema-bridge, .home-cinema-bridge-inner { min-height: 340px; }
      .home-cinema-bridge-inner p { font-size: clamp(43px, 11vw, 62px); }
      .home-products-cinema { padding-block: 75px; }
      .home-cinema-product, .home-cinema-product + .home-cinema-product { padding-block: 52px; }
      .home-concept { min-height: 340px; }
      .home-cinema-end { min-height: 210px; padding-block: 55px 70px; }
    }
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
